1. ngspice (portions derived from; Modified BSD / BSD-3-Clause)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Portions of RSpice's device models and transient engine are derived from, or
ported by study of, source files of the ngspice circuit simulator
(https://ngspice.sourceforge.io/), version 46. All such files are part of
ngspice's Modified BSD ("New BSD") licensed code base. No code was taken from
ngspice's LGPL components (src/maths/KLU, src/frontend/numparam, tclspice),
